title: BandLeader
---
RIFF: Yo yo yo yo yo! #line:riff_001
RIFF: Shit-zard Lizard Wizard BACK AT IT AGAIN! #line:riff_002
RIFF: I'm pumped, man! I'm PUMPED!! #line:riff_003
RIFF: I'm…too pumped? 
-> Uhh…you good, man?
    RIFF: I'm TOO good!
-> You're from the band that was playing next door?
    RIFF: Duh, I am!
RIFF: Shit-zard Lizard Wizard's head vocal-guitarist, fucking shit up since 2008. 
RIFF: The world's gotta watch out for our rad garage musical wizardry!
RIFF: My head is totally buzzing with thoughts, man!
RIFF: A totally overwhelming emotional adrenaline rush.
RIFF: AND I GOTTA GO TO BED!!!
RIFF: Got anything to help with that, potion lady?
<<stop>>
===

