title: BandLeader_Ending_Fursona
---
RIFF: Hgnrk… gnrkk… what's… happening to me…?
[Screen gets whited out. When it returns, Riff is a wolf.]
RIFF: AWOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOHLY SHIT!
RIFF: Is this real? I'm… a wolf? Am I dreaming?
RIFF: Lemme let you in on a little secret, potion lady.
RIFF: I fucking LOVE wolves.
RIFF: I love their awesome silver fur, those big, long snouts…
RIFF: Their rugged, muscular bodies…
RIFF: But y'know what I love most of all?
RIFF: Their sense of community. Their brotherhood.
RIFF: That's why I joined the Awoogas, dude.
RIFF: I wanted to be a part of something, to know that my pack is always there for me.
RIFF: But to them… I was never part of the pack…
RIFF: To them, I was always just… larping.
RIFF: But I don't need them anymore.
RIFF: I don't need approval from other wolves anymore.
RIFF: Because now. The wolf is INSIDE ME.
RIFF: The Awoogas used to laugh at my moon yodeling…
RIFF: But now…But NOW…
RIFF: LISTEN TO THE HOWL BOILING INSIDE MY SOUL
Riff goes into an insane moon-yodeling routine.
It's somehow shrill and guttural at the same time.
Like a bass-boosted mandrake scream.
It's really bad, but surprisingly authentic(?)
RIFF: I cannot WAIT to use that in my next song.
RIFF: I gotta thank you pretty lady.
RIFF: Whatever sick witchery you did with that concoction lifted some baggage I didn't even know I had.
RIFF: Now it's time for the world to see who Riff…
RUFF: No… who RUFF…really is.
RUFF: The true me.
RUFF: I'll see you later, Madame Potion Therapist.
RUFF: Or as they say in Lupese…
RUFF: AWOOOO WOOF WOOF RRGGH
<<stop>>
===

title: BandLeader_Ending_Recovery
---
RIFF: ...huh?
RIFF: Potion lady, is it just me or did you just get even shorter?
RIFF: And… I have… free hands?
RIFF: Wait, wait, wait, wait… did you…
RIFF: My head!? You fixed my head??
RIFF: That's amazing… You're amazing, dude!
RIFF: ...
RIFF: But… I think I need to turn this down.
Riff pulls out a pocket knife and… what the fuck he's cutting his head off again.
What the fuck. There's blood all over the floor.
This shithead snake-for-brains better clean this up after.
RIFF: Don't get me wrong, being beheaded is super tough!
RIFF: I have to blend all my meals and pour them down my neck.
RIFF: All my dates ever say to me is "my eyes are up here."
RIFF: And no matter how famous I get, my family doesn't really want to associate themselves with a "pathetic head-holder" like me.
RIFF: But… I'm proud that I overcame that stuff, y'know?
RIFF: And my head is proof of that.
RIFF: It's a part of myself that I actually… kinda like.
RIFF: Potion lady… You were really trying to do a good thing for me, huh?
RIFF: I guess most people just see my head as a stage prop.
RIFF: Or something I should be ashamed of.
RIFF: But you saw my head…and you were… worried for me…
Could be my imagination, but there's a weird mix of loneliness and comfort behind his shades.
Whatever it is… I think I might feel it too?
RIFF: Potion lady… let's see each other again, alright?
<<stop>>
===

title: BandLeader_Ending_Freedom
---
RIFF: ...
RIFF: Uh… dude? What's that sound?
RIFF: This is gonna sound crazy… but it's almost like there's a full band right above my head…
This guy's a little slow, huh?
I point to the top of his head. Riff slowly looks upward to his hair.
RIFF: Woah. Are you shitting me?
RIFF: Call me the bathroom at the ogre club after onion casserole night because you GOTTA be shitting me.
RIFF: Tammy!? Since when do you play bass, lil' man?
RIFF: Jeb on the drums? And Phil on the keys??
RIFF: ...Gertrude? You're the MANAGER??
RIFF: Holy shit. Potion lady, do you understand what this means?
RIFF: I'm a one man band. I can call my OWN shots now.
RIFF: No more NORMIES and SELLOUTS fuckin' with my vibe.
RIFF: Gertrude, fire my manager! Fire my PR team! Fire my whole fuckin' band!
RIFF: Cuz I feel a new SONG coming on..!!!
RIFF: I call this one, This Homemade Caviar is Hoppin, And By That I Don't Mean It's Good I Mean I Have 42 Frog Eggs Up My Ass (My Frog Neighbor Asked Me To Incubate Them But They Taste Awesome On Crackers So I've Been Eating A Few A Day.)
Riff breaks out into song.
"Song" might be too generous a term.
It's utterly incomprehensible.
But… seeing Riff have this much fun baring his soul in a shitty convenience store at 3AM…
I can't help but tap my fingers to the 29/16 time signature.
RIFF: I'm telling ya, the world is gonna know my voice!
RIFF: Not Shit-zard Lizard Wizard's voice, not the shitty record label's voice, but RIFF'S voice.
RIFF: And pretty lady…
RIFF: I want you in the front row seats when that time comes, ya hear me?
RIFF: Riff out!
<<stop>>
===

