RIFF: Woah…woah woah woah woah woah!
RIFF: I'm…totally feeling something, man. Like that time I went on a yoga retreat with that hot chick from Denver.
RIFF: They told us to imagine a lake of clear water.
RIFF: I could never do it. My creative mind's too spiky, ya know? But now…I think I get what they mean!
RIFF: I'm totally pumped down, man. The power of modern medicine.
RIFF: I'll definitely be back!
