title: BandLeader_Ending_Arousal
---
RIFF: Ohhh… This one tastes familiar.
RIFF: Ah, that's right. My fans give me a weird drink all the time that tastes just like this. Doesn't seem like anything special.
RIFF: They always seem disappointed after I finish drinking it. Almost like they're expecting something to happen?
RIFF: Anyway, I'm still pretty pumped. You got another potion that could help me calm down?
<<stop>>
