title: BandLeader_Ending_Furry
---
RIFF: Hm, this one doesn't seem to do anything.
RIFF: Are you sure you gave me the right potion?
RIFF: Well, actually, now that it's had time to simmer…It's making me feel kind of itchy?
RIFF: But also like I'm more comfortable in my own skin.
RIFF: It's…interesting. Do you have anything stronger than this?
<<stop>>
