title: BandLeader_Ending_Creativity
---
RIFF: Hm, this one doesn't seem to do anything.
RIFF: Are you sure you gave me the right potion?
RIFF: Well, actually, now that it's had time to simmer…It's kind of giving me an idea for a new song…
RIFF: But I always have ideas for a new song! I have way too many ideas!
RIFF: And my dumbass manager never lets me do them. Ugh.
RIFF: I always say to them, it's a dichotomy. You can't have Itchin' for Witch Bitches to Drop My Britches if you don't have Suckin' Werewolf Cock Makes Me Hard as Rocks.
RIFF: Like, c'mon. My fans know my history. It's nothing new.
RIFF: Anyway, this potion was interesting. You have anything stronger than this?
<<stop>>
===

title: BandLeader_Ending_Joy
---
RIFF: Holy moly! What a rush!
RIFF: It's like the after-show adrenaline rush, but better.
RIFF: It's almost enough to make me forget about my asshole manager…And my asshole drummer…
His face drops, like the potion's effects instantly wore off after those thoughts came back to him.
RIFF: I don't even want to think about it. Assholes everywhere! And not even pretty ones. Eugh!
RIFF: It's like they're double-teaming me.
RIFF: Well, not like that. Or…maybe like that? Metaphorically. Fuck.
RIFF: Anyway, I'm still pretty pumped. You got another potion that could help calm me down?
<<stop>>
===

