RIFF: He burps suddenly. Gross.
RIFF: I feel super full…Are you sure you gave me the right potion?
RIFF: It's like I just ate three $2 meal deals at Taco Bell. I love that shit, man.
RIFF: Crazy what potions can do. That one just saved me 6 whole dollars! Except, I guess I gotta pay for the potion too. Hm.
RIFF: Anyway, I'm still pretty pumped. You got another potion that could help calm me down?
<<stop>>
