RIFF: Ough…I think I'm going…to be sick…
RIFF: Potion lady…I thought you were gonna pump me down, but…THE THOUGHTS JUST WON'T STOP!!!
Behind his shades are the glazed-over eyes of someone who has suddenly been blasted with information they never asked for.
You fucked up, Lily.
RIFF: AHHHHHHHHHHH! I'VE BEEN EXPOSED TO THE SECRETS OF THE WORLD AND I'M NOT READY.
RIFF: I NEED MY DESIGNATED DRIVER…NO…I NEED MY MOM!
RIFF: I'M NEVER COMING BACK AGAIN!!
<<stop>>
