===

title: BandLeader_Check_0
---

Apparently, Riff got his start singing with an all-werewolf moon-yodeling group called the Awoogas.
There's a lotta old photos of him online in wolf ears and a tail, trying to fit in.
He's got a whole PR task force dedicated to taking those images down.
Story goes he had a falling out after accidentally killing the lead singer with silver jewelry.
The rest of the werewolves kicked him out, and the rest is history.
<<stop>>
===

title: BandLeader_Check_1
---

Riff put together Shit-zard Lizard Wizard in 2008 with 5 other reptilian monsters.
"Experimental neo-traditional techno dark-ambient Midwestern wizard emo rock with a pinch of Argentine Tango."
In other words, completely batshit crazy.
Riff's the creative muscle. He's behind classics like…
[i]Stick Your Wand Up My Ass Call it Higher Education.[/i]
[i]Itchin' for Witch Bitches to Drop My Britches.[/i]
And who could forget [i]Bristle Rash (Bangin' in the Back of My Broom).[/i]
Rumors say there's a lotta drama in the band because of how much they reel him in.
<<stop>>
===

title: BandLeader_Check_2
---

Riff's got some of the most insane head game in the industry. So they say.
All 61 snakes on his head have names, personalities, and weirdly loyal fanbases.
His signature move is chucking his head into the crowd and letting them throw it around.
Someone tries to run off with it every concert, but the snakes handle that pretty well.
Apparently it's considered shameful in gorgon culture to have a severed head.
Guess it works for his counter-culture brand though. Wonder how he feels about that…
<<stop>>
===